0..42 Comment "//! A constructor can hold a continuation."
43..46 Comment "//!"
47..116 Comment "//! An `A => T` field is the function former of the description code."
117..120 Comment "//!"
121..199 Comment "//! The code decodes the field to the thunked arrow of the native reading. The"
200..277 Comment "//! type keeps its rule. State programs form the free model of state. Put-put"
278..309 Comment "//! is a law for a state store."
